{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013FqwzaFwHgcDiqNk2hjFd2","type":"tool_result","content":"include: package:flutter_lints/flutter.yaml\nname: kredito\ndescription: Consumer loan registration and offers.\npublish_to: \"none\"\nversion: 1.3.0+27\n\nenvironment:\n  sdk: ^3.5.0\n\ndependencies:\n  flutter:\n    sdk: flutter\n  posthog_flutter: ^5.36.0\n\ndev_dependencies:\n  flutter_test:\n    sdk: flutter\n  flutter_lints: ^5.0.0\n\nflutter:\n  uses-material-design: true\n# kredito\n\nFlutter app (iOS + Android) for a consumer loan broker. The user registers\nwith an email and a phone number, picks the amount they want to borrow, accepts\nthe terms and gets a list of offers from partner banks. Two screens so far:\n`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart` and `lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`.\n\nAnalytics is PostHog (`posthog_flutter`), set up in `lib/analytics.dart` and\n`lib/main.dart`; screen views come from `PosthogObserver`. We are on the\nPostHog free tier. Product events are defined in `docs/EVENTS.md`; the\nscreens do not send any of them yet. Send events through `Analytics.capture`\nso the key and host stay in one place.\n/Users/valentinakoniukhova/development/flutter/bin/flutter\n/Users/valentinakoniukhova/development/flutter/bin/dart","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c4dab1ae-2575-4610-871a-56498c7534c3","uuid":"b2efd5ac-d38d-4031-a6eb-1cde017e0bf6","timestamp":"2026-10-27T05:50:45.990Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"include: package:flutter_lints/flutter.yaml\nname: kredito\ndescription: Consumer loan registration and offers.\npublish_to: \"none\"\nversion: 1.3.0+27\n\nenvironment:\n  sdk: ^3.5.0\n\ndependencies:\n  flutter:\n    sdk: flutter\n  posthog_flutter: ^5.36.0\n\ndev_dependencies:\n  flutter_test:\n    sdk: flutter\n  flutter_lints: ^5.0.0\n\nflutter:\n  uses-material-design: true\n# kredito\n\nFlutter app (iOS + Android) for a consumer loan broker. The user registers\nwith an email and